  "instructions": [
    "1. Cook prawns in boiling water for 2-3 minutes.",
    "2. Drain prawns and set aside.",
    "3. Cut crispy bread into small cubes.",
    "4. In a large bowl, combine mixed greens and crispy bread croutons.",
    "5. In a separate bowl, whisk together salad dressing, lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, and red pepper flakes.",
    "6. Pour the dressing over the greens and toss to combine.",
    "7. Add cooked prawns to the salad and toss gently to combine.",
    "8. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "9. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "10. Serve chilled and enjoy!"
